    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A kitchen sponge holder is a small open-"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "mesh construction",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "mesh-construction"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " pocket in fingering cotton: two small mesh rectangles joined at three sides, with a folded hanging loop at the top corner. The sponge tucks in, drips dry between washes, and the cotton holder machine-washes with your kitchen cloths. One 50 m ball of fingering cotton makes four holders."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
